flowchart TD
    A[Service playback snapshot] --> B{System or user event}
    B -->|Call or transient focus loss| C[Cancel Voice and pause or duck]
    C --> D{Four resume guards pass?}
    D -->|Yes| E[Service acknowledges Resume]
    D -->|No| F[Remain safe Paused]
    B -->|Headset or Bluetooth disconnect| G[Invalidate route and pause immediately]
    G --> H[Reconnect remains Paused]
    H -->|Explicit Resume on valid route| E
    B -->|Corrupt item| I{Playable next item?}
    I -->|Yes| J[Controlled service skip]
    I -->|No| K[End queue and manual recovery]
    B -->|Open Settings outside driving| L[Settings and Privacy]
    L --> M{Selected action}
    M -->|Permission or provider| N[Android Settings then recheck]
    M -->|Bluetooth P1| O[Save suggestion-only device]
    M -->|Consent| P[Accept decline or revoke]
    M -->|Clear data| Q[Select categories and confirm]
    Q --> R[Clear selected local/provider boundaries]
    R --> S[Cleared partial or retryable result]
    E --> A
    F --> A
    J --> A
